BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3235d40d-031c-4e6d-879a-8a6a190cb1b2@kit.events
DTSTAMP:20261029T080022Z
SUMMARY:Guesstronauts Trivia Game Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20260924T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20260924T200000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
DESCRIPTION:Trivia crossed with betting. The first game show we brewed
  ourselves.\n\nThe first game show we have brewed ourselves. One hour on a
  Thursday night\, in the taproom.\n\nIt is trivia crossed with betting.
  The questions still get asked\, but the points come from reading the
  room. Back your table\, back a stranger\, back yourself if you are
  feeling brave. Knowing the answer helps. Spotting who does helps
  more.\n\nNo team needed and no sign up. Turn up and we will get you into
  the game.\n\nWe wrote this one\, so come tell us what works and what does
  not.\n\nhttps://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/guesstronaut-trivia-game
 -night
URL:https://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/guesstronaut-trivia-game-night
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fc17d880-960e-4353-9066-f695ca9229a1@kit.events
DTSTAMP:20261029T080022Z
SUMMARY:Bike Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20261002T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20261002T210000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=FR
DESCRIPTION:Park your bike out front and show it off. Pedal or
  powered.\n\nEvery Friday from 6 to 9pm\, the parking lot is for bikes.
  Pedal or powered\, all of it counts: motorcycles\, scooters\, e-bikes\,
  road bikes. Park out front\, come in for a beer and a slice from Double
  D's\, and talk bikes with whoever else rode in. Free\, no
  sign-up.\n\nhttps://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/bike-night-fridays
LOCATION:Parking lot & taproom
URL:https://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/bike-night-fridays
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ec78e00f-dcf2-41e4-bda1-405a5a6ac87b@kit.events
DTSTAMP:20261029T080022Z
SUMMARY:Halloween Party
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DESCRIPTION:Kids' costume contest at 2\, adults' at 8. Plus a special
  Halloween beer.\n\nHalloween all day in the taproom on Saturday\, Oct
  31.\n\nTwo costume contests: kids at 2pm\, adults at 8pm. Come in costume
  for either\, or both.\n\nWe will have a special Halloween beer on tap: a
  pumpkin spiced English mild. At 4%\, it won't scare you off after
  one.\n\nhttps://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/halloween-party
URL:https://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/halloween-party
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:34a3568e-d6d8-40f9-89c0-bcf6dfb6181a@kit.events
DTSTAMP:20261029T080022Z
SUMMARY:Delo Apartments Halloween Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20261031T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20261031T160000
DESCRIPTION:Our neighbors' party\, with prizes from us. Win Tsar Bomba in
  the raffle.\n\nOur neighbors at Delo Apartments on Cannon St are throwing
  their resident Halloween party\, and Gravity is a proud sponsor.\n\nWe've
  put Gravity six packs and 750ml bottles of Tsar Bomba into the raffle.
  Delo residents\, come in costume and try your luck.\n\nThen keep the
  night going a short walk away: our own Halloween party runs all day in
  the taproom\, with the adults' costume contest at
  8pm.\n\nhttps://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/delo-apartments-hallowee
 n-party
LOCATION:Delo Apartments\, 1140 Cannon St\, Louisville
URL:https://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/delo-apartments-halloween-part
 y
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c4d33e03-b9f7-43b9-94ae-26bd841ba20e@kit.events
DTSTAMP:20261029T080022Z
SUMMARY:NFL Sundays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20260913T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20260913T190000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU;UNTIL=20270110
DESCRIPTION:Football all season. We open at 11\, and NFL gear gets $1 off
  your first beer.\n\nOpen at 11am.\n\nWear any NFL gear for $1 off your
  first beer!\n\nFootball is on our screens all season.\n\n**Sundays we
  open at 11am** for the early window. Thursday and Monday nights are on
  too\, during normal hours.\n\n**Wear any NFL gear\, get $1 off your first
  beer.** Any team.\n\nWe have the broadcast channels and ESPN\, not Sunday
  Ticket. So that is the Broncos every week plus whatever else Denver
  gets\, usually two or three games on a Sunday. Ring ahead and we will
  tell you what is on.\n\nBroncos games get their own listing\, and Broncos
  gear is worth $2 off those
  days.\n\nhttps://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/nfl-sundays
URL:https://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/nfl-sundays
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
