BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b5f50026-526a-4df8-ac2f-0cc777fa3717@kit.events
DTSTAMP:20261029T080022Z
SUMMARY:Cribbage Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20261027T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20261027T200000
RDATE;TZID=America/Denver:20261103T183000,20261124T183000
DESCRIPTION:Relaxed cribbage in the taproom. New? Come early for a beginner
  lesson.\n\nA low-key night of cribbage in the taproom. Grab a pint and a
  seat.\n\nNever played? Come at 6:30 for a beginner lesson. We'll walk you
  through the rules and play a practice hand together. Games start at
  7.\n\nWe'll have cards and a board to borrow. Bring your own cards or
  cribbage board and get $1 off your first drink.\n\nNot drinking? We have
  craft sodas too.\n\nFree to
  play.\n\nhttps://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/cribbage-night
URL:https://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/cribbage-night
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
