DESCRIPTION:A local homebrew club's monthly meeting. Members only.\n\nThe
  [Lafayette Area
  Brewers](https://www.facebook.com/groups/799823306718078/)\, a local
  homebrew club\, hold their monthly meeting at Gravity this month\, with a
  tour of our brewhouse. This month's topic is high gravity beers.\n\nThis
  is a private meeting for club members only. Homebrewers interested in
  joining can find the club on Facebook. The taproom stays open as usual\,
  so come in for a pint and trivia either
  way.\n\nhttps://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/lafayette-area-brewers-h
 omebrew-club
