BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:871c08e2-9da8-4d91-aa78-df7ab295ba25@kit.events
DTSTAMP:20261029T080022Z
SUMMARY:Battles & Brews
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20260825T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20260825T210000
RDATE;TZID=America/Denver:20260922T173000,20261110T173000,20261117T173000,2
 0261208T173000
DESCRIPTION:Tabletop D&D with professional Game Masters. Free to
  play.\n\nBattles & Brews brings professional Dungeons & Dragons to your
  favorite local taprooms\, delivering the adventure directly to you.
  Whether you've been rolling dice since the 80s or you're looking to join
  your very first quest\, there's a seat at the table for you.\n\nNo
  experience is required\, and all the gear is provided. We handle the
  heavy lifting—the world-building\, the maps\, and the Game
  Mastering—so you can focus on playing.\n\nFree to play. Grab a pint\,
  roll for initiative\, and let's make the night
  legendary.\n\nhttps://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/battles-brews
LOCATION:Taproom
URL:https://www.thegravitybrewing.com/events/battles-brews
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
